PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_GiveEnigmaBerry:
	.string "爸爸：嗨，{PLAYER}！\p"
	.string "我刚收到一颗非常稀有的树果。\n"
	.string "我想把它给你。$"

Route104_Text_PlantBerriesInSoilTakeThis:
	.string "你要是看到肥沃土壤里长出的树果，\n"
	.string "尽可以摘。\p"
	.string "不过一定要在同一处\n"
	.string "再种下一颗树果。这是基本的礼貌。\p"
	.string "来，我分你一份。$"

Route104_Text_TrainersOftenMakeMonHoldBerries:
	.string "看你这打扮，一定是训练家吧？\p"
	.string "训练家常常让宝可梦\n"
	.string "携带树果。\p"
	.string "是种树果还是用树果，\n"
	.string "全看你自己。$"

Route111_Text_WateredPlantsEveryDayTakeBerry:
	.string "我每天都给植物浇水。\n"
	.string "它们开出了好多花。\p"
	.string "还给了我好多树果。\p"
	.string "给你！\n"
	.string "你拿去吧！$"

Route111_Text_GoingToTryToMakeDifferentColorBerries:
	.string "我要好好努力，种出\n"
	.string "不同颜色的树果。\p"
	.string "希望你也努力！$"

Route111_Text_WhatColorBerriesToLookForToday:
	.string "不知道今天该去找\n"
	.string "什么颜色的树果呢？$"

Route114_Text_LoveUsingBerryCrushShareBerry:
	.string "我很喜欢用树果混合机，\n"
	.string "所以在收集树果。\p"
	.string "你要是愿意，我分你一颗。$"

Route114_Text_TryBerryCrushWithFriends:
	.string "你该和朋友一起试试\n"
	.string "树果混合机。$"

Route114_Text_FunToThinkAboutBerries:
	.string "该种哪种树果？\n"
	.string "树果是用掉还是攒着？\p"
	.string "想想就很有意思。$"

Route120_Text_BerriesExpressionOfLoveIsntIt:
	.string "树果靠吸收阳光成长。\p"
	.string "我们定时浇水，\n"
	.string "帮树果长大。\p"
	.string "这也是一种爱的表达，对吧？$"

Route120_Text_YesYouUnderstand:
	.string "对，对。\n"
	.string "你明白我的意思。\p"
	.string "这个你该收下。$"

Route120_Text_MakeYourOwnImpressions:
	.string "哦……不过自己形成看法\n"
	.string "也很重要，我想……\p"
	.string "这个给你。$"

Route120_Text_BerryIsRareRaiseItWithCare:
	.string "我觉得那颗树果很稀有。\n"
	.string "希望你能用心好好培育它。$"

Route120_Text_IllGetMoreBerriesFromBerryMaster:
	.string "我会再去树果大师那里\n"
	.string "多拿些树果。$"

LilycoveCity_Text_BerrySuitsYou:
	.string "说到底……\p"
	.string "就像西装最适合我，\n"
	.string "清爽的风最适合大海。\p"
	.string "而你，树果最适合你……\p"
	.string "为什么会这样呢？$"

LilycoveCity_Text_BecauseYoureTrainer:
	.string "说到底……\p"
	.string "因为你是训练家！$"

LilycoveCity_Text_PokeblocksSuitPokemon:
	.string "说到底……\p"
	.string "就像高雅的朴素最适合我，\n"
	.string "宝可方块最适合宝可梦。$"

Route123_BerryMastersHouse_Text_YoureDeservingOfBerry:
	.string "你可以叫我树果大师。\p"
	.string "我梦想让世界开满美丽的花，\n"
	.string "所以我培育树果，\l"
	.string "分给大家。\p"
	.string "你配得上这一颗！$"

Route123_BerryMastersHouse_Text_WhyBeStingyTakeAnother:
	.string "何必小气呢？\n"
	.string "再拿一颗！$"

Route123_BerryMastersHouse_Text_VisitPrettyPetalFlowerShop:
	.string "一定要去卡那兹附近的\n"
	.string "美丽花店看看。\p"
	.string "让世界开满花！$"

Route123_BerryMastersHouse_Text_DoneForToday:
	.string "我今天已经给完了。\n"
	.string "改天再来吧。\p"
	.string "让世界开满花！$"

Route123_BerryMastersHouse_Text_HeardAGoodSayingLately:
	.string "我丈夫种树果的本事，\n"
	.string "哦，那可是世界第一。\p"
	.string "他让我很骄傲。\p"
	.string "对了，孩子，你最近听过\n"
	.string "什么好话吗？$"

Route123_BerryMastersHouse_Text_InspirationalTakeThis:
	.string "啊！这话说得真了不起！\n"
	.string "真让人受鼓舞！\p"
	.string "这个我想给你。$"

Route123_BerryMastersHouse_Text_GoodSayingTakeThis:
	.string "哦！这话说得好。\n"
	.string "你相当了不起。\p"
	.string "这个我想给你。$"

Route123_BerryMastersHouse_Text_JoyNeverGoesOutOfMyLife:
	.string "我们的四个孙子该比我丈夫\n"
	.string "更有出息才行。\p"
	.string "我人生中的快乐从没断过！$"

Route123_BerryMastersHouse_Text_Ah:
	.string "啊……$"

Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_Text_ThisIsPrettyPetalFlowerShop:
	.string "你好！\p"
	.string "这里是美丽花店。\n"
	.string "把花传遍全世界！$"

Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_Text_LearnAboutBerries:
	.string "{PLAYER}{KUN}，你想了解\n"
	.string "树果吗？$"

Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_Text_IntroLearnAboutBerries:
	.string "你叫什么名字？\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n"
	.string "这名字真好听。\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}{KUN}，你想了解\n"
	.string "树果吗？$"

Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_Text_BerriesExplanation:
	.string "树果只长在松软肥沃\n"
	.string "土壤里的树上。\p"
	.string "摘了树果后，一定要\n"
	.string "再在松软土壤里种下一个。\p"
	.string "种下的树果很快会发芽，\n"
	.string "长成植株，开出美丽的花，\l"
	.string "然后再次结出树果。\p"
	.string "我想看到整个世界\n"
	.string "都开满美丽的花。\l"
	.string "那是我的梦想。\p"
	.string "请帮帮我，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n"
	.string "种下树果，让世界多些花。$"

Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_Text_FlowersBringHappiness:
	.string "花能给人带来这么多幸福，\n"
	.string "对吧？$"

Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_Text_YouCanHaveThis:
	.string "你好！\p"
	.string "你对花越用心，\n"
	.string "它们就开得越漂亮。\p"
	.string "你一定会喜欢照料花的，\n"
	.string "我肯定。这个给你。$"

Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_Text_WailmerPailExplanation:
	.string "树果正在生长时，\n"
	.string "就用吼鲸水壶浇水。\p"
	.string "哦，还有一件事。\p"
	.string "要是你很久不摘树果，\n"
	.string "它们会掉到地上。\l"
	.string "不过它们还会再发芽。\p"
	.string "是不是很棒？\n"
	.string "就像它们有活下去的意志。$"

Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_Text_ImGrowingFlowers:
	.string "我想像姐姐们一样。\n"
	.string "我也在种花！\p"
	.string "给你！\n"
	.string "这是给你的！$"

Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_Text_MachineMixesBerries:
	.string "你可以种树果，把它养大，\n"
	.string "也可以让宝可梦携带。\p"
	.string "不过现在有机器能把不同\n"
	.string "树果混合起来，做成给宝可梦\l"
	.string "吃的糖果。\p"
	.string "我也想尝尝糖果。$"

SootopolisCity_Text_NameIsKiriHaveOneOfThese:
	.string "嗨，你叫什么名字？\p"
	.string "… … …  … … …  … … …\n"
	.string "好。真好听！\p"
	.string "我叫小雾。\p"
	.string "爸爸妈妈给我起这名字，是希望我\n"
	.string "健康又温柔。\l"
	.string "那是他们的心愿。\p"
	.string "这个给你一颗。$"

SootopolisCity_Text_GiveYouThisBerryToo:
	.string "小雾再送你这颗树果！\n"
	.string "我真的很喜欢它！$"

SootopolisCity_Text_WhatKindOfWishInYourName:
	.string "不知道你的名字里\n"
	.string "藏着什么样的心愿。$"

SootopolisCity_Text_LikeSeasonBornIn:
	.string "春、夏、秋、冬。\p"
	.string "要是生在春天，你会喜欢\n"
	.string "春天吗？生在夏天的人，\l"
	.string "会喜欢夏天吗？$"

SootopolisCity_Text_ThenILoveAutumn:
	.string "后来纪莉出生在秋天，\n"
	.string "所以我就喜欢秋天！\p"
	.string "你喜欢哪个季节？$"

SootopolisCity_Text_OhDoesntMatter:
	.string "哦……\n"
	.string "没关系……\p"
	.string "我想知道的事情\n"
	.string "太多了……$"
